<title>KAZAKHSTAN: TABLE-KAZAKH IND. OUTPUT RISES 3.1 PCT IN JAN-JULY.</title>
<headline>TABLE-KAZAKH IND. OUTPUT RISES 3.1 PCT IN JAN-JULY.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's industrial output rose 3.1 percent in January-July of this year, compared to the same 1996 period, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKHSTAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   Jan-July 97    Jan-July 96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	     +3.1	     +0.1</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509 410</p>
